<div class="card-container">
    <div class="card">
        <h2>Innovating Through Technology</h2>
        <p>
            At Cloudsbay, we are dedicated to creating innovative solutions that address real-world challenges. Through cutting-edge technology and extensive research and development, we transform complex problems into elegant solutions.
        </p>
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>Problem Solving</h3>
                <p>We tackle complex challenges head-on, creating tailored solutions that make a difference.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>R&D Excellence</h3>
                <p>Our commitment to research and development keeps us at the forefront of technological innovation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>Technology Focus</h3>
                <p>We leverage cutting-edge technologies to build robust and scalable solutions.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .card-container {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 2rem 1rem;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .card {
        background: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 2rem;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        border: 1px solid rgba(242, 25, 5, 0.1);
    }

    .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--primary-color, #F21905);
        font-weight: var(--tremendous-weight, 800);
    }

    p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #fff;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .features {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .feature {
        background: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.5);
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        border: 1px solid rgba(242, 25, 5, 0.05);
    }

    .feature:hover {
        background: rgba(242, 25, 5, 0.1);
        border-color: rgba(242, 25, 5, 0.2);
    }

    .feature h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--primary-color, #F21905);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .feature p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: #fff;
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .card {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
        }

        .features {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 1rem;
        }
    }
</style>
